{"flags":[[1000000,0],[1000001,0],[1000002,0],[1000003,0],[1000004,0],[1000005,0],[1000006,0],[1000007,0],[1000008,0],[1000009,0],[1000010,0],[1000011,0],[1000012,0],[1000013,0],[1000014,0],[1000015,-1],[1000016,0],[1000017,400],[1000018,0],[1000019,0],[1000020,4],[1000021,99000012],[1000022,4],[1000023,99000025],[1000024,4],[1000025,99000025],[1000026,4],[1000027,98000001],[1000028,0],[1000029,1],[1000030,2],[1000031,3],[1000032,4],[1000033,5],[1000034,6],[1000035,7],[1000036,8],[1000037,9],[1000038,10],[1000039,11],[1000040,12],[1000041,13],[1000042,14],[1000043,15],[1000044,34],[1000045,35],[1000046,36],[1000047,77],[1000048,78],[1000049,33],[1000050,27],[1000051,28],[1000052,38],[1000053,39],[1000054,3],[1000055,25],[1000056,26],[1000057,30],[1000058,37],[1000059,10],[1000060,40],[1000061,41],[1000062,42],[1000063,43],[1000064,53],[1000065,80],[1000066,24],[1000067,64]],"messages":{"1000000":"Berini Village\n","1000001":"Berini Village\n","1000002":"I remember you.\n","1000003":"I see.\nYou're the one that killed my husband, right?\n","1000004":"I should have introduced myself to you earlier.\nI'm the wife of the ex-archbishop Jurg.\n","1000005":"No, I don't have a grudge against you.\n","1000006":"He went mad when our son was killed in the war.\n","1000007":"...\n","1000008":"...\n","1000009":"I would like to ask one thing of you...\n","1000010":"West of this village is another village where we used to live.\nThe village is now in ruins, and the demons occupy it.\n","1000011":"I would really appreciate it if you could go there\nand recover a remembrance from the days when we lived happily.\n","1000012":"You should find the remembrance somewhere in the ruins.\nCan you do this for me?\n","1000013":"You should find the remembrance somewhere in the ruins.\nCan you help me?\n","1000014":"Oh, that's it! It's a reminder of the first time\nmy husband and I met. Thank you very much!\n","1000015":"Thanks. I wouldn't be able to live without\nsomething to remember him by.\n","1000016":"I can't find the words to thank you enough.\nI will give you the right to use the Giant Warehouse VII\nand the Spirit Stone my husband often used.\n","1000017":"I'm not sure what it does, but I heard that the\nSpirit Stone enables you to quickly recover from injury.\n","1000018":"I really appreciate your help.\n","1000019":"I really appreciate your help.\n","1000020":"So, do you want to buy something or not?\n \n \u30fb~Buy Armaments         ~\n \u30fb~Buy Equipment         ~\n \u30fb~Identify Items        ~\n \u30fb~Repair Items          ~\n                                 ~QUIT~\n","1000021":" \u30fb~Arms               %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Head Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Body Armor         %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Shield             %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Leg Armor          %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~All Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n \u30fb~Non-Equipped Items %9d Gold~\n                           ~QUIT~\n","1000022":"Not enough money.\n","1000023":"Everything seems perfect.\n","1000024":"To identify your item, it costs %d in Gold.  Sound OK?\n \n                                 ~YES~  ~NO~\n","1000025":"You don't have anything that's unknown.\n","1000026":"I'm Zaperi.\n","1000027":"This village used to be populated and busy, but few remain now.\n","1000028":"I wonder where the evil creatures are coming from?\nThis village has become dangerous...\n","1000029":"Please buy something.\n","1000030":"My name is Meicin.\nI'm a holy spirit witch.\n","1000031":"I'm a replacement because\nmy predecessor didn't like this village.\n","1000032":"Holy spirits! Heal the wounds!\n","1000033":"Come see me when you're sick.\n","1000034":"I've got good things!\n","1000035":"This is Berini Village.\n","1000036":"It was a busy village, but now...\n","1000037":"After Archbishop Jurg passed away,\nMrs. Jurg was crushed...\n","1000038":"Ah, former Archbishop Jurg's home is right there.\n","1000039":"The forest around here also went completely white.\nIt didn't used to be like this.\n","1000040":"I wonder if the magic of Hiperion\nhas overwhelmed the forest?\n","1000041":"Nobody knows anything about this tower.\nNo one knows when it was made, who made it or what its purpose is.\n","1000042":"The door is sealed, too.\n","1000043":"A long time ago Berini Village was\nlocated to the west of this town, however\nit is now in ruins because of the demons.\n","1000044":"When the demons suddenly invaded,\nall the people in the village took sanctuary in this town.\n","1000045":"You can see the Ruins of Kashugal south of this town.\n","1000046":"Somebody said that the Green Orb is still stored in the ruins.\n","1000047":"You know what?\n","1000048":"Somebody told me that a wizard who knew about The Ruins of The Wise\nlives in a village of dwarves, far southeast of here!\n"},"status":[[0,7,4294967295,0],[0,3,10000000,2],[0,3,10000001,3],[0,3,10000002,4],[0,3,10000003,6],[0,5,4294967295,7],[0,0,10000300,10],[0,0,12000000,11],[0,1,12000000,20],[0,0,12000001,31],[0,1,12000001,34],[0,0,12000002,94],[0,1,12000002,102],[0,0,12000100,108],[0,1,12000100,109],[0,0,12000003,110],[0,1,12000003,111],[0,0,12000004,115],[0,1,12000004,116],[0,0,12000005,120],[0,1,12000005,121],[0,0,12000006,125],[0,1,12000006,126],[0,0,12000007,130],[0,1,12000007,131],[0,0,12000008,135],[0,1,12000008,136],[0,0,12000009,140],[0,1,12000009,141],[0,5,4294967295,145],[0,0,10000200,153]],"blocks":[[[6,[[1,0],[1,26]]],[6,[[1,1],[1,27]]],[6,[[1,2],[1,36]]],[49,[[2,1000000]]],[50,[[4,1000005]]],[0,[[4,1000005],[0,0],[1,50],[0,1]]]],[[16,[[4,1000064],[1,0],[6,10000200],[7,10000200]]]],[[17,[[1,4000002],[1,2]]]],[[17,[[1,4000001],[1,0]]]],[[0,[[12,39],[0,1],[1,0],[0,5]]]],[[17,[[1,4900003],[1,0]]]],[[17,[[1,4080000],[1,0]]]],[[0,[[12,39],[0,1],[1,0],[0,8]]],[0,[[12,39],[0,0],[1,0],[0,9]]]],[[56,[[1,10001020],[1,1],[1,0],[1,0]]],[56,[[1,10001021],[1,0],[1,0],[1,0]]]],[[56,[[1,10001020],[1,0],[1,0],[1,0]]],[56,[[1,10001021],[1,1],[1,0],[1,0]]]],[[41,[[0,0]]]],[[18,[[1,12000000]]],[21,[[1,12000000],[1,0]]],[